{"amendments":[{"amends":"782a5e5dee09e6a17f6475f978b3f25fa90bdc1fb84cb64e27e5a042afa93577","at":"2026-11-13","changes":["Spec-1 amendment 3 (spec1Sha256 335ec5cfcb48410c37543d3f4995b0d98a7e841e76f0b3040c28ef734f2dcfc6): quarter-hour capture-markets reads (cg_price_usd_15m keyed to the slot; the hourly grid, universe and Activity unchanged), temperature-readings at every quarter hour (at :15 every step unchanged), the interim reading P2.0 with its own reference (interim_composites, interim_references), the back-calculated P2.0 reference job (temperature-interim-reference), Positioning's per-run records (positioning_runs), the backfill's family-wide freshness and 5% missing hours, and a daily market_chart client method for the 18-month history.","replay-readings leaves P2.0 rows out (ReplayEngine.ignoredMethodVersions); the evaluator (src/track) is unchanged, and P2.0 readings carry origin backfilled, so track/clock.ts never makes their pairs eligible and looks.ts never reads them for H1 or H2.","Registered files added: src/engines/temperature/interim.ts, src/engines/temperature/interim-reference.ts and the job entry point src/jobs/temperature-interim-reference/main.ts."],"disclosure":"Code registration amendment 1 (13 Nov 2026), before any evaluation data: the registered code now carries Spec-1 amendment 3 (the interim price-action reading P2.0 until first light, quarter-hour capture and Temperature, Positioning's per-run records, the 90-day backfill's re-run rules and the 18-month history fetch). The evaluator, the archive, Activity and the hypotheses are unchanged. The synthetic suite differs only in the Spec-1 hash it names; the replay suite adds Temperature's one :45 step, every :15 reading unchanged. Interim and back-calculated readings are never evaluated. It amends 782a5e5dee09e6a17f6475f978b3f25fa90bdc1fb84cb64e27e5a042afa93577.","id":"code-amendment-1","logged":[{"after":"7111772a4e7cded33d1f2f0cc9a8b31b90380aab5233c43911a50f245bd165a5","before":"fe5c8ede79